---
title: Placing an order
---
flowchart LR
    %% a comment that is ignored
    cliente([Customer]) -->|places an order| web[Web store]
    subgraph backend [Backend]
        direction TB
        api{{Orders API}} --> valida{In stock?}
        valida -- Yes --> reserva[[Reserve stock]]
        valida -- No --> aviso>Notify the customer]
        reserva ==> pago[/Card payment/]
        subgraph datos [Data]
            db[(PostgreSQL)]
            cache((Redis))
        end
        reserva --> db
        api -.-> cache
    end
    web --> api
    pago --> fin(((End))) & correo@{ shape: doc, label: "Confirmation email" }
    aviso --x cliente
    web e9@--> analitica[Analytics]
    e9@{ animate: true }
    classDef critico fill:#fdd,stroke:#c00,stroke-width:2px
    class valida,pago critico
    style db fill:#9cf,stroke:#036
    linkStyle 0 stroke:#0a0
    click web "https://example.com/tienda" "The online store"
